gh-merge-verified: REFUSING TO MERGE -- this tool cannot prove it is the current version, so its admission check may not exist in this copy.
    this copy is 4e90a65316ae, dev-hermit main has 463581578a60

  A stale lander does not fail; it SKIPS the changes-request check and reports a
  clean landing. That is indistinguishable from a checked one, which is why this
  refuses rather than warning.

  Run from a fresh checkout, or refresh this one (`make checkout-fresh` in dev-hermit).
  If the reviewed pull request changes this file, pass --run-current-main-copy;
  the modified copy will fetch and start the exact verifier from main, and only
  that reviewed copy will perform admission and the merge.
  Pass --verify-only only to prove an already-performed merge; it performs no
  admission and is not a route for landing a change to this file.
